{"_type": "issue", "id": "ema_vwap-l7v.13", "title": "Scope paper positions and equity by account", "description": "Ledger cash is keyed by account_id, but paper_positions has no account_id and is unique only by exchange/symbol; get_total_equity sums all positions regardless of account. PaperTradingEngine exposes account_id, so non-default engines can see or mutate another account's positions and use them for sizing. Decide whether multi-account is supported; either persist/account-scope positions throughout APIs and queries or remove/reject unsupported account IDs.", "acceptance_criteria": "- [ ] Make position ownership explicit and consistent with ledger account_id, or reject non-default account IDs if single-account is the intended contract\\n- [ ] Scope get/list/save/close positions and equity calculations to the same account\\n- [ ] Define uniqueness across account, asset, and strategy/profile identity\\n- [ ] Migrate existing paper_positions data without losing open positions\\n- [ ] Test two accounts holding the same asset and verify balances, positions, and equity do not cross-contaminate", "status": "closed", "priority": 1, "issue_type": "bug", "owner": "hermes-agent-nous-research@users.noreply.github.com", "created_at": "2026-10-01T04:01:42Z", "created_by": "Hermes Agent", "updated_at": "2026-10-01T04:02:07Z", "closed_at": "2026-10-01T04:02:07Z", "dependencies": [{"issue_id": "ema_vwap-l7v.13", "depends_on_id": "ema_vwap-l7v", "type": "parent-child", "created_at": "2026-10-01T04:01:42Z", "created_by": "Hermes Agent", "metadata": "{}"}, {"issue_id": "ema_vwap-l7v.13", "depends_on_id": "ema_vwap-l7v.9", "type": "supersedes", "created_at": "2026-10-01T04:02:07Z", "created_by": "Hermes Agent", "metadata": "{}"}], "dependency_count": 0, "dependent_count": 0, "comment_count": 0}
