{"_type": "issue", "id": "ema_vwap-8ig.3", "title": "Add shared Optuna study storage and worker coordination", "description": "Process workers cannot coordinate through Optuna's default InMemoryStorage. Implement the storage and coordinator selected by the architecture decision, with a unique study identity per optimization request and safe concurrent worker attachment. Ensure temporary storage cleanup occurs only after workers stop, and do not use SQLite as the parallel trial store.", "acceptance_criteria": "- [ ] Create one isolated study per optimize request and allow all child processes to attach safely\\n- [ ] Use the selected supported same-host storage; document that JournalStorage file locking assumes a local filesystem\\n- [ ] Ensure bounded worker shutdown precedes journal/file cleanup, including exceptions and cancellation\\n- [ ] Validate exact trial accounting and no cross-request study or result leakage\\n- [ ] Exercise worker death/stale trial behavior and cleanup on Windows", "status": "closed", "priority": 1, "issue_type": "task", "assignee": "Hermes Agent", "owner": "hermes-agent-nous-research@users.noreply.github.com", "created_at": "2026-10-01T03:41:47Z", "created_by": "Hermes Agent", "updated_at": "2026-10-02T00:22:53Z", "started_at": "2026-10-01T23:56:52Z", "closed_at": "2026-10-02T00:22:53Z", "close_reason": "Closed", "dependencies": [{"issue_id": "ema_vwap-8ig.3", "depends_on_id": "ema_vwap-8ig", "type": "parent-child", "created_at": "2026-10-01T03:41:47Z", "created_by": "Hermes Agent", "metadata": "{}"}, {"issue_id": "ema_vwap-8ig.3", "depends_on_id": "ema_vwap-8ig.1", "type": "blocks", "created_at": "2026-10-01T03:41:51Z", "created_by": "Hermes Agent", "metadata": "{}"}], "dependency_count": 1, "dependent_count": 1, "comment_count": 0}
