{"_type": "issue", "id": "ema_vwap-pbo", "title": "Optuna optimization correctness and robustness audit", "description": "Audit and harden the Optuna strategy optimization system end to end: objective direction and ranking, conditional trial search construction, candidate parameter fidelity, multi-objective validity, batch settings, statistical robustness, and trial execution performance. Establish deterministic tests for every corrected contract and ensure API-visible results accurately identify valid selected trials.", "acceptance_criteria": "- [ ] Confirm every configured metric uses the correct maximize/minimize direction and matching result ranking\\n- [ ] Ensure trial candidates vary intended parameters and preserve all non-optimized base settings\\n- [ ] Validate multi-objective metrics, invalid trials, Pareto selection, and finite API serialization\\n- [ ] Verify batch and search-bound settings are honored and relationally feasible\\n- [ ] Assess optimization overfitting/reporting and trial runtime/reproducibility\\n- [ ] Add focused tests for identified bugs and regression contracts", "notes": "All audit child issues are complete. Optuna objectives, candidate construction, Pareto safety, batch bounds/trade floors, in-sample reporting/deployment validation, seeded reproducibility, shared-feature reuse, and thread concurrency documentation are implemented or resolved. Full validation: 384 passed, 2 skipped. Threaded n_jobs did not improve measured runtimes; process backend was deferred as a larger storage/data-transfer design.", "status": "closed", "priority": 1, "issue_type": "epic", "owner": "hermes-agent-nous-research@users.noreply.github.com", "created_at": "2026-10-01T02:18:31Z", "created_by": "Hermes Agent", "updated_at": "2026-10-01T03:17:21Z", "closed_at": "2026-10-01T03:17:21Z", "close_reason": "All audit and follow-up tasks are complete with validated corrections and documented performance limitations.", "dependency_count": 0, "dependent_count": 0, 