{"_type": "issue", "id": "ema_vwap-dtg", "title": "Multi-coin multi-timeframe Optuna sweep with ranked leaderboard", "description": "Feature: automated batch Optuna optimization across a configurable list of symbols and timeframes, with results ranked by target metric (Sharpe, Calmar, etc.) into a persistent leaderboard.\n\nSCOPE:\n1. BATCH SWEEP ENGINE (src/batch_optimizer.py)\n   - BatchOptimizerConfig: symbols list, timeframes list, days, n_trials, target_metric, strategy_mode\n   - BatchOptimizer.run() iterates symbol x timeframe combos sequentially\n   - Persists each result to SQLite (new batch_results table): symbol, timeframe, exchange, run_timestamp, target_metric, best_value, best_params JSON, trade_count, sharpe, calmar, win_rate, max_drawdown\n   - Returns ranked leaderboard sorted by best_value descending\n   - Gracefully skips combos with insufficient data or zero trades\n\n2. TIMEFRAME RESAMPLING ROBUSTNESS (src/data_loader.py)\n   - Exchange native TF gaps:\n     * Gemini API: supports 1m, 5m, 15m, 30m, 1h, 6h, 1d natively\n       Missing: 3m (derive from 1m), 2h (derive from 1h), 4h (derive from 1h)\n     * KuCoin: supports 1m, 3m, 5m, 15m, 30m, 1h, 2h, 4h, 6h, 1d natively\n   - Add EXCHANGE_NATIVE_TFS dict mapping exchange -> set of supported TFs\n   - In load_candles(): if requested TF is not natively supported by exchange,\n     find the best lower native TF donor and resample up via resample_and_upsert\n   - Fix fetch_gemini_historical(): 3m/2h/4h keys in gemini_tf_map are wrong\n     (Gemini API 404s silently); replace with resample-from-donor path\n   - resample_and_upsert(): accept optional target_tfs param to limit which\n     derived TFs are computed (avoids full chain when only one TF is needed)\n\n3. BATCH API ENDPOINT (src/app.py)\n   - POST /api/batch_optimize: accepts BatchOptimizeRequest (symbols[], timeframes[],\n     exchange, days, n_trials, target_metric)\n   - Runs as background FastAPI BackgroundTask, streams progress via SSE or\n     stores progress in a shared dict polled by GET /api/batch_status\n   - POST /api/batch_results: returns stored leaderboard from SQLite sorted by metric\n   - GET /api/batch_status: returns {running: bool, progress: {done, total, current_combo}}\n\n4. UI (src/web/)\n   - New 'Batch Sweep' tab or panel in index.html\n   - Symbol list input (comma-separated or multi-select)\n   - Timeframe multi-select checkboxes\n   - Run button + progress bar showing current combo\n   - Leaderboard table: rank, symbol, TF, best metric value, trades, sharpe,\n     drawdown, best params summary; sortable columns\n   - 'Apply' button per row to load that combo's best params into strategy config", "status": "closed", "priority": 2, "issue_type": "task", "assignee": "unknown", "created_at": "2026-08-18T22:01:43Z", "created_by": "unknown", "updated_at": "2026-08-18T22:43:27Z", "started_at": "2026-08-18T22:24:23Z", "closed_at": "2026-08-18T22:43:27Z", "close_reason": "Closed", "dependency_count": 0, "dependent_count": 0, "comment_count": 0}
