{"_type": "issue", "id": "ema_vwap-5fp", "title": "Implement Paper Trading Portfolio Ledger Module with Per-Asset Optuna Parameter Profiles", "description": "Develop an isolated Paper Trading Portfolio & Transaction Ledger Module to forward-test calibrated Optuna strategy parameters in simulated real-time on a per-ticker and per-crypto asset basis.\n\nKey Features:\n1. Per-Asset Optuna Profile Registry: Save, manage, and assign custom hyperparameter profiles (EMA lengths, VWAP slope thresholds, ATR multipliers, R:R targets, stop types) discovered during Optuna optimization to specific symbols (e.g., BTC/USDT, ETH/USD, AAPL, SPY).\n2. 1-Click 'Deploy to Paper Ledger': Direct button in Optuna Optimization results panel to instantly apply and activate best-found trial parameters into the paper trading engine for that symbol.\n3. Virtual Order Execution & Fill Simulator: Simulates market/limit order fills, realistic slippage, maker/taker exchange fees, and active Stop-Loss/Take-Profit management on live/polling candle updates.\n4. Transaction Ledger & Audit Trail: Double-entry style paper ledger logging all virtual orders, executions, position states, realized/unrealized PnL, cash balances, and trade metrics in a dedicated SQLite ledger table.\n5. Interactive Paper Trading Dashboard: Web UI tab displaying active paper positions, per-asset live PnL, cumulative paper equity curve, trade log table with filterable exit reasons (TP, SL, timeout), and performance analytics.", "design": "1. In src/paper/ or src/ledger.py, implement PaperTradingEngine and TransactionLedger managing virtual balances, order states, and position lifecycles.\n2. In database.py, add tables: paper_profiles, paper_positions, paper_ledger_transactions, paper_trade_history.\n3. Add /api/paper/* endpoints in app.py for profile management, ledger history, active positions, and manual reset.\n4. Integrate 'Deploy to Paper Trading' action into Optuna UI and add dedicated 'Paper Trading' tab to the Web Dashboard.", "acceptance_criteria": "1. Optuna results UI allows saving and deploying optimized parameter sets to individual ticker/crypto asset profiles.\n2. Paper trading engine executes virtual trades based on live/polling market data using each asset's specific Optuna parameters.\n3. Dedicated SQLite transaction ledger records all paper orders, fills, fees, trade logs, and equity changes.\n4. Paper trading UI dashboard displays real-time simulated positions, trade history, per-ticker stats, and portfolio equity curve.", "status": "closed", "priority": 2, "issue_type": "feature", "created_at": "2026-08-18T17:01:49Z", "created_by": "unknown", "updated_at": "2026-08-24T22:14:38Z", "closed_at": "2026-08-24T22:14:38Z", "close_reason": "Closed", "dependency_count": 0, "dependent_count": 0, "comment_count": 0}
